{"availability":"available","full":"onflow/cadence","name":"cadence","description":"Cadence: the resource-oriented smart contract programming language of the Flow network. Capability-based security, type safety, and move semantics","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":548,"forks":152,"created":"2020-04-17T23:09:27Z","updated":"2026-09-02T19:09:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://cadence-lang.org","topics":["blockchain","blockchain-development","cadence","cadence-language","capability-based-security","flow","language","programming-language","resource-oriented-programming","smart-contracts","type-safety","web3"],"demo":"https://play.flow.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.793Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.793Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.793Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.793Z","stars":548,"forks":152}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Cadence is the native smart contract programming language of the Flow network. It is resource-oriented, capability-based, and designed by smart contract engineers to prevent the vulnerability classes that plague Solidity development.","Cadence is the native smart contract programming language of the Flow network. It is resource-oriented, capability-based, and designed to prevent entire vulnerability classes at compile time rather than relying on developer discipline.","Resource-oriented programming pairs linear types with object capabilities. A resource can only exist in one location at a time, cannot be copied, and cannot be accidentally lost or deleted. This models digital ownership declaratively and is enforced by the compiler."],"features":["What: Cadence is the resource-oriented smart contract programming language used on the Flow network.","Who it's for: developers building on Flow who want compile-time safety, resource semantics, and capability-based access control. Also: teams coming from Solidity who have been burned by reentrancy, unlimited approvals,…","Why use it: Cadence prevents entire vulnerability classes at the compiler level. Assets are resources, not ledger entries. Reentrancy attacks are significantly mitigated by Cadence's resource ownership model. Approvals…","Status: Cadence 1.0, current release v1.10.2. Live on Flow mainnet.","License: Apache 2.0."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/onflow/cadence/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ae63512aaccabf20d32001def56735f775885a3c3e04f5b814ce03cdb5608e17","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.876Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.876Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Cadence is the native smart contract programming language of the Flow network. It is resource-oriented, capability-based, and designed by smart contract engineers to prevent the vulnerability classes that plague Solidity development.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/onflow/cadence/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ae63512aaccabf20d32001def56735f775885a3c3e04f5b814ce03cdb5608e17","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/onflow/cadence/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.876Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-02T19:09:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/onflow/cadence/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:35.877Z","hash":"ae63512aaccabf20d32001def56735f775885a3c3e04f5b814ce03cdb5608e17","originalBytes":8714,"storedBytes":8714,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cadence","flow","language","access","contract","resource-oriented","cadence-lang.org","cannot","capability-based","developer","docs","programming","reference","resource","resources","control","reentrancy","smart","type","assets","enforced","live","network","ownership","runtime","what","who","browser","classes","designed","development","entitlements","fine-grained","functions","hello","native","object","only","playground",